WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:02.220
Tonight on Nova.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:04.900
10-month-old Laura has cancer.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.160
But this house plant contains a chemical that may save her life.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.660
From everyday painkillers to prescription heart medications,

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:17.300
modern pharmacies are stocked with powerful drugs that were first derived from plants.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:23.670
Scientists are searching for new medicines among the exotic plants of the tropical rainforest.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:28.610
But will they find tomorrow's wonder drugs before the forest disappears?

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:31.470
Tonight on Nova.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.690
The hidden power of plants.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.540
Thank you.

