00:24:25.160 --> 00:24:29.240
The Western reaction to some of these medical practices is often a skeptical one.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:36.030
One of the things you learn in working with these different cultures is these people have a different approach, in many cases, to curing and healing.

00:24:36.430 --> 00:24:45.620
