00:24:45.820 --> 00:24:50.800
and defines the cause of the illness and attempts to cure it through contact with the spirit world.

00:24:51.080 --> 00:24:58.400
There's a wonderful quote where it said the white man goes into his church and talks about Jesus, and the Indian goes into his teepee and talks to Jesus.

00:25:00.030 --> 00:25:07.410
In ceremonies like this one, the patients entrust their health and their lives to an ancient alliance between the natural and the supernatural.

00:25:12.100 --> 00:25:19.660
There will often be further treatment with herbal medicines, and some of the hallucinogens themselves may prove to have important medical applications.

00:25:20.890 --> 00:25:28.970
In the 1940s, Professor Schultes was working with Indians in the Northwest Amazon, and he found them using the sap of a tree of the nutmeg family for two purposes.

