The sea is really a rather harsh environment in the sense that everything grows on everything else and everything eats everything else.

00:36:51.020 --> 00:36:57.160
So that something that's just sitting there, like sponges or tunicates, really have to have some way of defending themselves.

00:36:58.160 --> 00:36:59.760
The tunicates are especially interesting.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:06.960
creatures they are just sitting there and they are invertebrates like sponges they don't have

